From 18de83e3cd373d75c892ce0bcf37a4fac49040fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunrisepeak <speakshen@163.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:24:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] [clangd] Reuse fully observed semantic module scan failures

Preserve diagnostics without publishing failed providers; revalidate exact request inputs and cancellation. Observe real paths and compact only identical idempotent facts while retaining ordered directory operations. Bound complete manifests to 8192 facts under the existing shared 32 MiB metadata budget.

Consolidates preserved commits 0aa9f31a5 and its cancellation follow-up.
